==Overview==
==={{ALttP|-}}===
{{Stub|ALttP}}

==={{LA|-}}===
{{Stub|LA}}
In {{LA}}, [[Link]] can Run in any the four cardinal directions by using the [[Pegasus Boots]].<ref name="LADX Instruction Booklet 20"/> By Running into them, Link can break the green [[Crystal]]s that would normally block his path in [[Dungeon]]s or [[Cave]]s.<ref name="LADX Instruction Booklet 20"/> He can also Run into a [[Bookcase]] located in the [[Village Library]] to make ''[[The Hidden Power of Color]]'' fall on the ground, allowing him to read it. Link can Run into two [[Treasure Tree]]s, near [[Tail Cave]] and near the [[Telephone Booth]] in [[Ukuku Prairie]] respectively, to reveal [[Secret Seashell]]s.<ref name="LADX Prima 110"/> Link can also find [[Fairy|Fairies]] by ramming into [[Objects]].{{Which|LA}}{{Where|LA}}<ref name="LADX Prima 2"/>

Running can help Link reach [[Vacuum Mouth]]s and avoid being crushed by [[Thwomp]]s. Link can combine Running with his [[Sword]] to perform a [[Dash Attack]].<ref name="LADX Instruction Booklet 20"/> He can also use the [[Roc's Feather]] while Running to perform a [[Long Jumping|Long Jump]], allowing him to clear large gaps.<ref name="LADX Instruction Booklet 19"/>

