==={{TMC|-}}===
Link can Run Like the Wind whenever he has the [[Pegasus Boots]] &ndash; obtained after waking up [[Rem]] with a [[Wake-Up Mushroom]] &ndash; equipped. Once Link has the Pegasus Boots, he can learn the [[Dash Attack]] from [[Swiftblade]]; if the other [[Item]] he has equipped is a [[Sword]], Running Like the Wind will automatically make him perform a Dash Attack.

