==={{BotW|-}}===
Sprinting is used to move faster and avoid enemy attacks in {{BotW}}. It costs [[Stamina]], and cannot be used if the [[Stamina Wheel]] is empty. If [[Link]] [[Jump]]s while Sprinting, he will Jump farther. Sprinting will produce noise, even if Link has a boost to his [[Stealth]] from [[Stealth Up]].

