<!-- Majora's Mask -->
<ref name="MM Instruction Booklet 19">{{Cite Manual|quote= '''{{Big|Walk / Run}}'''<br>Tilt the Control Stick in the direction you want to move. The move Link performs will vary depending on how much you tilt the Control Stick. It is best to tilt the Control Stick lightly and walk slowly on tricky ledges. {{Color MM|Manual Red|If you hold {{Icon|MM Z}} while moving, Link can move forward, back, left or right while facing forward.}}|game= MM|page= 19}}</ref>
<ref name="MM3D Prima 15">{{Cite Guide|MM3D Prima|page= 15}}</ref>

