<ref name="TWW Instruction Booklet 16">{{Cite Manual|quote= '''{{Big|Walk / Run / Swim / Jump}}'''<br/>Tilt {{Icon|TWW Control Stick}} in the direction you want to move. Your traveling speed depends on how far you tilt {{Icon|TWW Control Stick}}. If you want to jump from a platform or ledge, just run toward the edge and you'll jump automatically.|game= TWW|page= 16}}</ref>
<ref name="TWWHD Manual 11">{{Cite Manual|quote= {{Big|Walk/Run/Swim/Jump}}<br/>Move in the direction {{Icon|TWWHD L Stick}} is tilted. You will jump automatically when you run toward a ledge.<br/>You can adjust your speed depending on how far {{Icon|TWWHD L Stick}} is tilted.|game= TWWHD|page= 11 (Basic Actions)}}</ref>

