<ref name="TPHD Manual 12">{{Cite Manual|quote= '''{{Big|Walk/Run/Swim/Jump}}'''<br/>Move and swim using {{Icon|TPHD L Stick}}. Link's movement speed depends on how far you tilt {{Icon|TPHD L Stick}} in a direction. Link will jump automatically when he runs off a ledge. Additionally, you can press {{Icon|TPHD A}} while moving to roll quickly in the direction you're heading, letting you slam into walls and other things.|game= TPHD|page= 12 (Basic Actions)}}</ref>

